      "title": "Electro-mechanical parking brake and brake-pedal weld recalls (early build)",
      "description": "The Q2/SQ2 platform was subject to early safety recalls affecting braking. UK/EU recall records list (1) an electro-mechanical park brake that could release inappropriately (e.g. when releasing the clutch) on cars built around 2017–2018, and (2) an EU recall over a manufacturing weld joint between the brake pedal and its plate that could break under sudden hard braking, risking complete brake-pedal failure. While the parking-brake recall predates SQ2 sales, the platform/brake-pedal actions are relevant to early SQ2-era build dates and owners should confirm by VIN.",
      "solution": "These are recall items — have the VIN checked against the Audi/DVSA recall database and any open campaign rectified free of charge at a dealer. Report any abnormal parking-brake behaviour or a soft/abnormal brake pedal immediately.",
